julia/Manifest.toml is generated by Julia Pkg.
It records standard-library versions. Those libraries stay under the Julia MIT License.
This sidecar does not relicense them.
The Manifest file itself is project metadata and is distributed with the AGPL-3.0-only source tree.
An inline SPDX header is omitted so a future Pkg.resolve rewrite is not fought by a hand-maintained banner, and so the file is not mistaken for a relicensing of Printf, Sockets, or Test.
